            </note>
            <note corresp="#d10-f2" n="33" xml:id="d10-f2-content">
                <p>For text of the Pepper resolution of February 19, 1945, see telegram 76, May 8,
                    1946, to Tirana, <ref target="#pg20">p. 20</ref>.</p>
            </note>
